---middleware
middleware aik aesa func hai jo kisi bhi route se pehle chalta hai jiska matlab apka route chalne d=se pehle agr aap ka
 koi kaam krana chate ho toh middleware ko chalaya ja skta hai
 jese route chalne se pehle print kro consloe pr route chala
 route chalne se pehle hit counter pr route hit counter ki value brhaooo

 ~~iska matlab route chalne se pehle jo chalega woh hai middleware
 **sirf aik masla hai agr hamara middleware chl gya toh hamamri request jam ho jati hai or route n=tk nhi ja pati
   toh hame us req ko push krne k liye next() chalan prhta hai k ap agle route pr jao

   ##middkeware ka syntax kuch yioo hai
   app.use((req,res,next)=>{
    console.log("i am middleware");
    next();
   })